    "description": "Open Mentalism 2.3 - Brilliance. Spells for creating and controlling light and darkness, auras, and light-based attacks including Shock Bolt, Sunfires and Hand of Fire. Special Notes: None of the Aura spells (Self Aura and True Aura) are cumulative with each other or with the Blur spell.",
